error[SC0104]: white space outside ASCII after `#` makes no directive
   ╭─[ white_space_outside_ascii_after_a_hash_is_refused_in_a_group_that_is_compiled.c:1:1 ]
   │
 1 │ # define X 1
   │ ┬  
   │ ╰── directive begins here
───╯
  = note: `clang -E` refuses such a line, and `clang` reads it as a directive; after a directive's name it is white space
